        "contenuto_esteso": "Rep. Andy Barr (R-Ky.) is leading in the Republican primary for Kentucky’s U.S. Senate seat, according to new polling data published Thursday. The Emerson College Polling/FOX56 survey found that 28 percent of likely GOP Kentucky voters support the sitting lawmaker in the primary contest. Barr is up against Attorney General Daniel Cameron and businessman Nate..."
